---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/page-layouts.css';
---

<Layout
title="About — Mike Trounce"
description="I'm wired as an entrepreneur, not a consultant — how I actually operate, and why that's closer to a co-founder than a contractor."
>
<div class="options-page">
<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Mike Trounce</a>

<h1>About</h1>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>How I operate</h2>
<p>
I'm wired as an entrepreneur, not a consultant. That means I'd rather notice something's wrong and just fix it than write you a brief about it. I spotted Freddy's flyer had the wrong website address on it simply by staying in regular contact with him — not from a briefing document — and it was fixed inside the hour.
</p>
<p>
Think of it less like hiring an outside contractor and more like picking up a co-founder for a few hours a week — someone who's actually built and sold a company, gets into the actual detail, and moves at the speed a founder moves at, not the speed an agency moves at.
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>The detailed version</h2>
<p>
Ten years in specialist financial data before this, among other things — the full history, employers, and education are on the <a href="/michael-trounce-cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CV (PDF)</a>, if that's what you're after.
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>A quick introduction</h2>
<div class="intro-video">
<video controls preload="metadata" poster="/media/mike-intro-poster.jpg" playsinline>
<source src="/media/mike-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
</video>
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>Where else to find me</h2>
<p>
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-trounce/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> for the career history above, in its usual format. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@michaeltrounce3746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a> for video. Instagram and X to follow once there's something worth posting there.
</p>
</section>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.intro-video {
width: 100%;
max-width: 480px;
